# Sprint 9 Day 3 — added after fee-service kept booting stale classes.
# Without this, `docker build` COPY . . pulls every local target/ and
# node_modules/, and Maven inside the image re-uses those compiled
# classes instead of rebuilding from source. Caught when fee-service
# kept crashing with the pre-fix DlmmJwtAutoConfiguration even after
# the source fix had landed.

# Maven build output (must always rebuild from source in image)
**/target/
**/*.class

# Frontend build artefacts (image's Dockerfile re-runs npm ci + build)
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# IDE + OS junk that shouldn't be in build context
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Git metadata (image doesn't need git history)
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Claude worktree state (orchestration metadata)
.claude/

# Docs are not needed at runtime
docs/
*.md
!Dockerfile*.md

# Test/load artefacts
loadtest/results/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/coverage/

# Env / secret files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
